#. module: l10n_cssk_oss_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_oss_base/models/cssk_oss_return.py:0
msgid ""
"%(move)s, line '%(line)s', carries the OSS tag but %(n)s OSS taxes, so its "
"member state and rate cannot be determined. Correct the document (one OSS "
"tax per line) and compute again."
msgstr ""
"%(move)s, riadok '%(line)s', má štítok OSS, ale %(n)s daní OSS, takže "
"nemožno určiť štát spotreby ani sadzbu. Opravte doklad (jedna daň OSS na "
"riadok) a vypočítajte znova."

#. module: l10n_cssk_oss_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_oss_base/models/cssk_oss_return.py:0
msgid ""
"%(move)s: the member state of consumption of its OSS supply cannot be "
"determined (tax %(tax)s belongs to no single OSS fiscal position, and the "
"document has neither a fiscal position with a country nor a customer "
"country)."
msgstr ""
"%(move)s: nemožno určiť členský štát spotreby jeho dodania OSS (daň %(tax)s "
"nepatrí jedinej fiškálnej pozícii OSS a doklad nemá fiškálnu pozíciu s "
"krajinou ani krajinu zákazníka)."

#. module: l10n_cssk_oss_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_oss_base/models/cssk_oss_return.py:0
msgid ""
"%(rate)s from the company rate table (fixing %(day)s). The OSS return must "
"use the ECB rate for the last day of the period — check it and confirm."
msgstr ""
"%(rate)s z kurzového lístka spoločnosti (fixácia %(day)s). Priznanie OSS "
"musí použiť kurz ECB platný posledný deň obdobia — overte ho a potvrďte."

#. module: l10n_cssk_oss_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_oss_base/models/cssk_oss_return.py:0
msgid "%s is not an EU member state"
msgstr "%s nie je členským štátom EÚ"

#. module: l10n_cssk_oss_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_oss_base/models/cssk_oss_return.py:0
msgid "%s rate not confirmed as the ECB reference rate"
msgstr "Kurz %s nie je potvrdený ako referenčný kurz ECB"

#. module: l10n_cssk_oss_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_oss_base/models/cssk_oss_return.py:0
msgid ""
"A correction must concern a quarter from Q3 2021 up to the one before this "
"return."
msgstr ""
"Oprava sa musí týkať štvrťroka od 3. štvrťroka 2021 po štvrťrok "
"predchádzajúci tomuto priznaniu."

#. module: l10n_cssk_oss_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_oss_base/models/cssk_oss_return.py:0
msgid ""
"A row cannot be negative. A credit note that corrects an earlier quarter "
"must name its original invoice (it then becomes a correction of that "
"quarter); otherwise enter the correction by hand."
msgstr ""
"Riadok nemôže byť záporný. Dobropis, ktorý opravuje skorší štvrťrok, musí "
"odkazovať na pôvodnú faktúru (potom sa stane opravou toho štvrťroka); inak "
"zadajte opravu ručne."

#. module: l10n_cssk_oss_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_oss_base/models/cssk_oss_return.py:0
msgid ""
"A supply consumed in the member state it is made from belongs on that "
"state's domestic return, not on the OSS return."
msgstr ""
"Dodanie spotrebované v štáte, z ktorého sa uskutočňuje, patrí do tuzemského "
"priznania tohto štátu, nie do priznania OSS."

